      "id": 54589,
      "name": "Wuischke",
      "username": "Wuischke",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/w/ba8739/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-03-11T21:40:58.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If anyone has found a shop(that ships to europe) in europe or the UK that sells the mini expansions I'd be quite keen to know about it. I've been googling around but coming up with nothing. &nbsp;and every day that passes the shipping costs seem less insane just to get that juicy extra sentinels content. I don't really have a FLGS to ask about it and the last time i tried there. the salesman gave me a confused and bedazzled look. Or maybe I just have that effect on people.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>some sort of list of known retailers in different parts of the world might also help people get all the heroes they need to save the multiverse more easily. Maybe there is such a list and I just didn't see it. &gt;_&gt; In that case please enlighten me :) .</p><p>any information would be appreciated :)&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
