      "created_at": "2013-03-12T21:57:25.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>We sent a pallet with a bunch of mini expansions (and everything else) to a distributor in the UK last week, and we'll be sending some more to a distributor in Germany this week, so hopefully those are on sale in the next month or so somewhere in Europe. I know, however, that it can take a month or more between trans-Atlantic shipping time, and waiting for distributors to send it to retailers, etc.</p>",
